{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791039098,"nonce":"LgWCSpxfjngx1CwYlQLCOQS5J9g=","message":"Per-side border widths and outlines landed in 6c6e91d. The box shader now reads all four widths (ashui writes a uniform border as four equal ones, so Blinc's [w,0,0,0]-is-uniform encoding is gone); a node's sides come from RenderProps.border_sides over border_width, in one colour, and the children's clip insets by each side. Outlines are a border-only PRIM_RECT grown by offset + width, corners following the box's radii, drawn after the fill; Tailwind's ring- classes map to it, the offset's gap left clear rather than filled with ring-offset colour. New props BorderTop/Right/Bottom/LeftWidth, OutlineWidth, OutlineOffset, OutlineColor (ids 60-66).\n\nStill to port: per-side border colours (4 rects under a rounded clip in Blinc), inner and circle shadows, clip_fade and circle/ellipse/polygon clips, CSS filters and mask gradients, opacity layers, glass/blur/image brushes. The record is at 16 rows, the vertex-attribute limit, so the next item that needs a field moves records to a storage buffer.","files":null}]}